# Hits: StartTransaction and Commit in one routine that handles exceptions (a try..except at or after the start), no Rollback on that connection or transaction
# anywhere in it (19), or a Rollback that belongs to another connection (31). Not a hit: no try..except at all (12), the exception goes to the caller.
# Non-hits: Rollback in the except part, in a finally, through the Transaction object, and a
# routine that only starts the transaction (the caller commits or rolls back).
!transaction-without-rollback 12
transaction-without-rollback 19
transaction-without-rollback 31
!transaction-without-rollback 43
!transaction-without-rollback 58
!transaction-without-rollback 71
!transaction-without-rollback 84
